        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-5178-6764"><seg source="#source-5178-5184">Ｍ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5184-5196"><rb>氏</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5196-5217"><rb>夫婦</rb><rt>ふうふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5217-5229">がやつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5229-5241"><rb>来</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5241-5247">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5247-5262"><rb>型</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5262-5271">どほり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5271-5295"><rb>各人</rb><rt>かくじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5295-5298">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5298-5322"><rb>紹介</rb><rt>せうかい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5322-5334">されたが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5334-5349"><rb>彼</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5349-5352">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5352-5379"><rb>御多分</rb><rt>ごたぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5379-5382">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5382-5394"><rb>洩</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5394-5400">れず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5400-5415"><rb>唖</rb><rt>おし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5415-5439">であつた。しかし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5439-5454"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5454-5463">には一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5463-5478"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5478-5484">や二</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5484-5499"><rb>度</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5499-5502">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5502-5526"><rb>洋行</rb><rt>ようこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5526-5550">したことのあるＮ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5550-5562"><rb>