145-29148">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29148-29160"><rb>引</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29160-29163">つ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29163-29175"><rb>張</rb><rt>ぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29175-29193">つたりして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29193-29205"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29205-29208">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29208-29220"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29220-29241">らないばかりに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29241-29256"><rb>劬</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29256-29292">はつてくれるのであつた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29292-29310"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29310-29316">がＩ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29316-29328"><rb>子</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29328-29334">との</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29334-29355"><rb>事件</rb><rt>じけん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29355-29367">でＭ、Ｈ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29367-29379"><rb>氏</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29379-29382">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29382-29406"><rb>攻撃</rb><rt>こうげき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29406-29427">されたことを、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29427-29445"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29445-29448">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29448-29469"><rb>悲観</rb><rt>ひかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29469-29502">してゐるやうなことを、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29502-29520"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29520-29523">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29523-29541"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29541-29544">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29544-29568"><rb>最近</