        <p source="#source-29982-30209"><seg source="#source-29982-29985">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29985-30012"><rb>段々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-29994-30000">だん</seg><choice source="#source-30000-30009"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30012-30015">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30015-30039"><rb>友達</rb><rt>ともたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30039-30042">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30042-30054"><rb>亡</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30054-30081">くなつて、ほんとに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30081-30096"><rb>寂</rb><rt>さび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30096-30126">しいんですものね。お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30126-30144"><rb>体</rb><rt>からだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30144-30147">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30147-30168"><rb>大事</rb><rt>だいじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30168-30177">にして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30177-30192"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さいね。」</p>
